@Meteo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136
@bearerToken = replace-with-accessToken-from-login-response

### Login as admin
POST {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin-password"
}

### Login as operator
POST {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "operator",
  "password": "operator-password"
}

### Get latest measurement
GET {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/current
Accept: application/json

### Post calibration data (JWT admin required)
POST {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/calibration
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

{
  "temperature": [0.1, -0.2],
  "pressure": [1.0, 0.5]
}
